Audit complete: **FAIL / NOT_LEGIT**.

The clean proof reproduced `#Top`, but it replaces real helper and loop execution with an unconstrained `oddDigits` oracle reused in the postcondition. Setting `oddDigits(2) => true` allowed the theory to prove the false result `[2]`, while the real program returns `[]`.

